      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 edit with a prompt enhancer\n\nOne language model on your own server does two jobs here: it rewrites your short request into a full edit prompt, and it is the text encoder for Qwen-Image 2.1. ComfyUI loads no text encoder.\n\n**You need**\n1. The **ComfyUI-UniversalConditioner** node pack.\n2. The Qwen-Image 2.1 adapter in `models/universal_conditioner/`.\n3. The Qwen-Image 2.1 text encoder file in `models/text_encoders/`. It is read from disk for its token table and never loaded onto the GPU.\n4. A server with the model loaded that answers `/v1/hidden_states` and `/v1/chat/completions`.\n\n**To use it**\n1. Set the same server address on **Universal Conditioner** and **Prompt Enhancer**.\n2. Load your picture.\n3. Write what you want in a few words. Put text that must appear in the picture in double quotes.\n4. Run. **Enhanced prompt** shows what was sent to the model.\n\nTurn `enhance` off to compare with your own words. Change the enhancer's `seed` for another wording. For a second picture, connect it to `image_2` on both the enhancer and the text encode node, in the same order."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Qwen-Image 2.1 edit with a prompt enhancer\n\nOne language model on your own server does two jobs here: it rewrites your short request into a full edit prompt, and it is the text encoder for Qwen-Image 2.1. ComfyUI loads no text encoder.\n\n**You need**\n1. The **ComfyUI-UniversalConditioner** node pack.\n2. The Qwen-Image 2.1 adapter in `models/universal_conditioner/`.\n3. The Qwen-Image 2.1 text encoder file in `models/text_encoders/`. It is read from disk for its token table and never loaded onto the GPU.\n4. A server with the model loaded that answers `/v1/hidden_states` and `/v1/chat/completions`.\n\n**To use it**\n1. Set the same server address on **Universal Conditioner** and **Prompt Enhancer**.\n2. Load your picture.\n3. Write what you want in a few words. Put text that must appear in the picture in double quotes.\n4. Run. **Enhanced prompt** shows what was sent to the model.\n\nTurn `enhance` off to compare with your own words. Change the enhancer's `seed` for another wording. For a second picture, connect it to `image_2` on both the enhancer and the text encode node, in the same order."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
